That is good to hear. As I wrote, I do not have practical experience  
with PM only chips.

I do have experience with a custom chip where the 13 base of the MM  
probe is not (necessarily) the complement of the corresponding PM  
base, but just one of the 3 possible other bases. In that case the  
makecdfenv functions parses the CDF file and seemingly returns a  
proper object. Closer inspection reveals it is wrong however. But  
that is a particular degenerate example.

Kasper


